# The composed layers that owe a sum exactly, and in which quantity. One row per (fusion,
# quantity) not suspended on any ground and not filed `derived`: the filed figure must equal the
# sum of the converted parts, less the eliminations filed against that quantity.
#
# A derived composed figure owes no equality
#   It declares itself the sum, so there is nothing filed to compare it with.
#   composition/derived_fusions.sqlc names those pairs and they leave beside the suspensions; the
#   figure is computed in composition/derived_quantities.sqlc instead.
#
# The `quantity` column is the grain
#   Every fusion is paired with every quantity `pm.summed_quantity` declares, the set itself rather
#   than whichever quantities some layer happens to file, and the suspended pairs are removed:
#   composition/suspended_quantities.sqlc, where a ground naming no quantity has already been
#   expanded onto all of them. It reads that set rather than composition/suspension_grounds.sqlc,
#   and the `EXCEPT` would have been immune either way, which is exactly how a bag can go
#   unnoticed.
#
# The filter the composition argument turns on
#   An anti-join is a filter, and this one is the filter the whole composition argument turns on.
#   `x_composed = F Φ x_parts − e` is not a law of the model; it is an obligation a document takes
#   on by saying it looked. This relation is the set of documents that took it on, so it is the
#   honest denominator for every claim that the composition rule holds.
#
# Written as `EXCEPT`, which is what the sentence means
#   "pm.part minus the two suspensions" written as a `LEFT JOIN` with a NULL test is an idiom that
#   names the left operand and buries the right one inside an `ON` clause. `EXCEPT` names both, in
#   the order the sentence reads, and the set difference is exact here because both arms are the
#   bare key: fusions is already `SELECT DISTINCT`, and `EXCEPT` deduplicates.
#
# Not a general substitute for the anti-join
#   `composition/leaves.sqlc` projects `d.*` and carries the left row's payload through, which
#   `EXCEPT` cannot do: it compares whole rows and returns only what both arms can spell. Key-only
#   difference is the case that converts.
#
# A short result is not evidence on its own
#   An empty or short result is not evidence here on its own. ⚠️ `EXCEPT` shares precedence with
#   `UNION` in Postgres and associates left, so a missing pair of parentheses returns the wrong set
#   rather than an error, and a wrong set of composed layers is a perfectly ordinary table.
#
# The law is recomputed, not recorded
#   algebra/owed_equality.sqlc asserts |A| = |A∖B| + |A⋉B| over these operands on every run, so a
#   number written here would be a number nobody recounts. Read it there.
-- composition/fusions.sqlc for every quantity, minus the suspensions that lift each sum and the
-- composed figures filed `derived`.
SELECT f.filing, f.layer, q.quantity
FROM      (
    :compose(composition/fusions.sqlc)
) f
CROSS JOIN unnest(enum_range(NULL::pm.summed_quantity)) AS q(quantity)
EXCEPT
(
    SELECT s.composition, s.composed_layer, s.quantity
    FROM (
        :compose(composition/suspended_quantities.sqlc)
    ) s
    UNION
    SELECT d.filing, d.layer, d.quantity
    FROM (
        :compose(composition/derived_fusions.sqlc)
    ) d
)
